# Griselbrand: "Flying, lifelink" and "Pay 7 life: Draw seven cards." Entomb puts it into the graveyard and Reanimate
# brings it back at the cost of 8 life (20 -> 12). Paying 7 (12 -> 5) draws seven. With 5 life left the ability cannot be
# paid again (CR 119.4: a player can pay life only if their life total is at least that much): refused, though Griselbrand
# is untapped and in play.

